### ============================================================
### Graphiti ETL Admin API - HTTP test file
### Usage: VS Code REST Client plugin -> click "Send Request"
### Prerequisite: uvicorn api.main:app --reload
###              NEO4J_ENABLED=true in .env
### ============================================================

### Variable
@host = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@prefix = {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/admin/etl


### ----- 1. ETL Table Status (watermarks) -----

GET {{prefix}}/status
Accept: application/json


### ----- 2. ETL Metrics -----

GET {{prefix}}/metrics
Accept: application/json


### ----- 3. Trigger Full Sync (async, returns immediately) -----

POST {{prefix}}/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sync_type": "full"
}


### ----- 4. Trigger Incremental Sync (async) -----

POST {{prefix}}/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sync_type": "incremental"
}


### ----- 5. Check Sync Task Status -----
### Poll this after triggering to see running/completed/failed

GET {{prefix}}/sync-status
Accept: application/json


### ----- 6. ETL Traces (recent sync timing trees) -----

GET {{prefix}}/traces
Accept: application/json


### ----- 7. Init Mock Data (seed 20 tables before ETL) -----

POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/init-data


### ----- 8. Health Check -----

GET {{host}}/health
